{"resourceIdentifier":"3945","resourceName":"Yangxiang AWMS GHG Mitigation Project In Anhui Province","description":"The project activity uses flushing system to collect the manure automatically. All the manureand wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The separated solid will be treatedinaerobic composting system to produce fertilizer. The separated liquid will be treated throughanaerobic digestion, The biogas produced during the treatment process will be collectedandutilized or directly incinerated (Each instance may have some differences). The sludge producedfrom anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solidandthe effluent will be used as a liquid organic fertilizer for the irrigation of agriculture","location":{"latitude":32.193233,"longitude":116.891068},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-02","endExclusive":"2023-04-02","endInclusive":"2023-04-01"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3945"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Yangxiang Breeding Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12974"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/04/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/06/2021 - 31/05/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":